# Normalize line endings across all platforms.
# Git stores text files with LF in the repository and checks them out with LF
# everywhere (eol=lf), eliminating the "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings
# Epic 1 emitted on Windows. `text=auto` lets Git detect text vs binary so
# binary files are never corrupted by EOL conversion.
* text=auto eol=lf
